      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, akukasakasa yakuluwa, akukeŋa yatama hatudidi twawu! Chikukucha to-o hiyakuvikoŋa nikuyikoŋa, Muloŋa Ŋovu yakuyikoŋa yidi kumakasawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afwilaŋa maha, hiyakuyitambula naŋovu; nimatala nawa, hiyakuyihukula. Akabishaŋa muntu nimutaŋa windi kumu, yowu muntu nawuswana windi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi Yehova nahoshi nindi, Tiyenu, chisakichi nukuchikasila chuma chatama chimwakakaŋanya kufumisha nshiŋu jenu, himwakenda nakudivunaku; muloŋa wakekala mwaka watama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku odu akayitila chishimu, akayimbila mukeŋa wakudila, nawu, Tunanoŋi dehi chikupu; wabalumuna dehi iseka dawantu ami. O chaditutululaŋayi dehi nakudifumisha kudami! Maha etu wayibalwila dehi akwakudikaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi wakabula muntu wakanata mwonji wachinjikijilu chakusakula nachu muchipompelu chaYehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adi nakuprofweta nawu, Enu bayi muprofwetaŋaku. Nawu, Yuma yidi chochochu hiyayitenaŋa kukuprofwetaku; neyi ochu, kusawuka hikwakatufumaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu akwamutaŋa waYakoba, antu hiyadi kuhosha mwenomuku; Spiritu yaYehova anayikeheshi, tahindi? Yumiyi diyi yelaŋayi yena? Mazu ami hiyawahishaŋa muntu wendaŋa cholokaku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwinza mafuku awa antu ami ananyamuki neyi chilumbu. Antu adi nakudihitila chakadi kwakama, abula kukeŋa njita, mudi nakuyilotokela nakuyivùula yikutu yawu yavwalaŋawu hewulu dyuma yawu yakuvwala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ambanda akumuza wami munayihaŋi mumatalawu amawahi; anyanawu anyanya munayifumishi kuwaha kwami chahaya nyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
